      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY BABY BROOKE (2) was well fancied but drifted back before winding up with a late dash home to place, 0.8 lengths from the winner (29.98) at this track in Grade 5. Good beginner aided by a nice draw. Well placed and gets her chance. ZIPPING MERRITT (1) turned in a fair 5th placed finish last time at this track over 520m (30.27). Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Should be thereabouts. TIP ME FRANK (3) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 1.75 lengths at this track in a handy 21.10 beating Rita's Miracle. Leading player again. HEY ALDO (5) comes here off a freshen-up and must be included.",
